# Four Corners: a room in each corner, each opening towards the middle,
# and a pinwheel of walls round the centre.

NAME Four Corners
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS C M
START 16 16 SE

# The top-left room: a wall down from the top and one in from the left,
# leaving the corner between them open.
MOVE 9 1
DRAW 9 5
MOVE 1 9
DRAW 5 9

# One blade of the pinwheel.
MOVE 15 9
DRAW 15 11
